Package: rknpu-dkms
Architecture: arm64
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: rocket-dkms, rknpu-native-dkms
Replaces: rknpu-native-dkms
Description: DKMS source for the mainline Rockchip RK3588 RKNPU driver
 This package provides the Rockchip RKNPU kernel module source
 for use with DKMS on arm64 systems. It targets the mainline
 rockchip,rk3588-rknn-core device tree node and supports 3-core
 concurrency, 800 MHz devfreq, and large LLM model loading with
 per-domain IOMMU isolation.
